\code{\link[=robots_validate_url]{robots_validate_url()}} to fetch and validate, \code{\link[=robots_fetch]{robots_fetch()}} for
acquisition evidence, and \code{\link[=allowed_by_robots_text]{allowed_by_robots_text()}} for URL decisions.
}
